Package: apt.cydiakk.qqhelper
Name: QQ Helper
Version: 1.2.7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: QQ Helper for QQ 4.7.2 / 5.7 / 5.9 / 6.2 on iOS 5 through 10. One source with runtime class detection, so each version hooks only what exists. Recall and anti-revoke need QQ 5.9 or newer; 4.7.2 ships without recall at all.
Maintainer: Netskao
Author: Netskao
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 5.0), preferenceloader
Replaces: apt.cydiakk.qqhelper (<< 1.2.7)
Provides: apt.cydiakk.qqhelper (= 1.2.7)
